[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14884.349, "timestamp": "04:08:04", "text": "わかった。待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14887.11, "timestamp": "04:08:07", "text": "えっと、たくさん見逃しているような気がする"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14889.429, "timestamp": "04:08:09", "text": "みんな、兄弟。私は恋しいです 私は自分が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14890.67, "timestamp": "04:08:10", "text": "ない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14894.71, "timestamp": "04:08:14", "text": "人々。人が恋しい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14900.64, "timestamp": "04:08:20", "text": "キモタス。私は話しましたか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14908.469, "timestamp": "04:08:28", "text": "キマザン？待って、キモダザンってこんな感じじゃない？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14939.63, "timestamp": "04:08:59", "text": "[音楽]"}]